  <text>
    <body>
      <p source="#source-54-86"><seg source="#source-54-86">あくたうかべる朝の水</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-86-124"><seg source="#source-86-124">ひらととびかふつばくらめ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-124-156"><seg source="#source-124-156">苗のはこびの遅ければ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-156-190"><seg source="#source-156-190">熊ははぎしり雲を見る</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-190-222"><seg source="#source-190-222">苗つけ馬を引ききたり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-222-254"><seg source="#source-222-254">露のすぎなの畔に立ち</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-254-277"><seg source="#source-254-277">権は朱塗の盃を</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-277-313"><seg source="#source-277-313">ましろきそらにあふぐなり</seg></p>
    </body>
